\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Turrets &amp; Traps! </h2><br>Each has its own upgrade tree with 100+ upgrades in all!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.webm?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.mp4?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight Epic Boss Battles! </h2><br>Use strategy, wit, and fast reflexes to outmaneuver massive monsters!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/c81a3215e84b8ebc85d7c95605458c76.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/c81a3215e84b8ebc85d7c95605458c76.webm?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/c81a3215e84b8ebc85d7c95605458c76.mp4?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Powerful Artifacts! </h2><br>Dragonfire Boots, Lionheart Shield, Gurrakk's Warhammer, and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/71cc313bcb72c8bf05d83d6a63ac61f0.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/71cc313bcb72c8bf05d83d6a63ac61f0.webm?t=173990084